msgid ""
"A fragmented smart home experience often means juggling multiple apps to "
"control different devices. Matter eliminates this frustration by enabling "
"users to control <strong>all Matter-compatible devices from a single "
"app</strong>, such as Apple Home or Google Home."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_matter_standard_the_key_to_a_seamless_smart_home
msgid ""
