"system"
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"A homeowner who often has guests or service providers might worry about "
"providing physical keys to multiple people. With SmartphoneKey, they can "
"share a <strong>temporary digital key</strong> that expires after a set "
"period. The homeowner knows exactly who has access, and when the key is no "
"longer needed, access can be easily revoked. This setup keeps the home "
"secure without the hassle or security risk of physical keys."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"A major challenge in smart home technology has been <strong>compatibility "
"between devices from different brands.</strong> The introduction of the "
"<strong>Matter standard</strong> solves this issue by allowing smart devices"
" from Apple, Google, Amazon, and others to work together effortlessly."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.resource_matter_thread
msgid ""
"A mesh depends on the roles of its devices, their placement and power, and "
"the route to the internet. Coverage depends on the building, placement and "
"radio conditions, so plan it for the site and check it after installation. "
"When the route to the internet is lost, remote management waits for it to "
"return; read"
msgstr ""
"Mesh-мережа залежить від ролей її пристроїв, їх розміщення та живлення, а "
"також від маршруту до інтернету. Покриття залежить від будівлі, розміщення "
"та радіоумов, тому плануйте його під конкретний об’єкт і перевіряйте після "
"монтажу. Коли маршрут до інтернету зникає, віддалене керування чекає, доки "
"він відновиться; дізнайтеся,"

