#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_matter_standard_the_key_to_a_seamless_smart_home
msgid ""
"The smart home industry has long faced a major "
"challenge—<strong>compatibility issues between devices from different "
"brands</strong>. Homeowners often struggle with fragmented systems where one"
" device works with Google Home but not with Apple Home, or vice versa. "
"<strong>Enter Matter</strong>, the <strong>universal smart home "
"standard</strong> designed to eliminate these barriers."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model:spk.website.resource,direct_answer:spk_website_v2.post_matter_standard_the_key_to_a_seamless_smart_home
msgid ""
"The smart home industry has long faced a major challenge—compatibility "
"issues..."
